        "title": "Women’s Golf Team Earns Record Finish at SLIAC Championships",
        "content": "<p>The women’s golf team at Zachary University finished second at the SLIAC championships last week, marking their best-ever finish at the event, according to school officials.</p>\n<p>All five scoring players earned All-SLIAC honors by finishing in the top 16. Seniors Ashley Estabrook and Addi Campbell tied for sixth place with a 236 score, each setting the school record for best 54-hole score by an individual and earning first-team All-SLIAC recognition.</p>\n<p>Three other players — Reagan Darden (10th), Isabel Velasquez (12th) and Lindsey Reimsnyder (13th) — received second-team All-SLIAC honors.</p>\n<p><em>Source: <a href=\"https://owlsathletics.com/news/2026/10/12/zacharys-owl-of-the-week-the-womens-golf-team.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Original Article</a></em></p>\n",
        "excerpt": "<p>The women’s golf team secured its best-ever finish at the SLIAC championships, with all five scoring players earning All-SLIAC honors.</p>\n"
      },
      "patch": {
        "title": "Mississippi University for Women Golf Team Earns Record SLIAC Finish",
        "excerpt": "Mississippi University for Women finished second at the SLIAC women’s golf championships, its best showing at the event, with all five scoring players earning all-conference honors.",
        "content": "<p>Mississippi University for Women’s women’s golf team finished second at the St. Louis Intercollegiate Athletic Conference championships, the program’s best finish at the event, according to an Oct. 12 report from the school.</p>\n<p>All five scoring golfers placed in the top 16 to earn All-SLIAC honors. Seniors Ashley Estabrook and Addi Campbell shared sixth place at 236 strokes apiece. Their 54-hole totals set the school’s individual record, and both earned first-team recognition.</p>\n<p>Reagan Darden finished 10th, Isabel Velasquez 12th and Lindsey Reimsnyder 13th. Each received second-team All-SLIAC honors.</p>\n<p><em>Source: <a href=\"https://owlsathletics.com/news/2026/10/12/zacharys-owl-of-the-week-the-womens-golf-team.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mississippi University for Women Athletics</a></em></p>\n<p><em>Correction: An earlier version misidentified the school. The golfers represent Mississippi University for Women.</em></p>",
