        "title": "William Carey Lady Braves rally to beat Mississippi Valley State in four sets",
        "content": "<p>The William Carey Lady Braves rallied from a first-set loss to defeat Mississippi Valley State in four sets Sunday afternoon in Lorman, Mississippi.</p>\n<p>The Lady Braves lost the opening set 25-19 but responded with wins of 25-18, 25-19, and 25-17 to secure the victory.</p>\n<p>Details of individual performances were not provided.</p>\n<p><em>Source: <a href=\"https://alcornsports.com/news/2026/10/11/womens-volleyball-lady-braves-rally-from-first-set-loss-to-beat-mvsu.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Original Article</a></em></p>\n",
        "excerpt": "<p>The William Carey Lady Braves overcame a first-set loss to defeat Mississippi Valley State in four sets on Sunday.</p>\n"
      },
      "patch": {
        "title": "Alcorn State Lady Braves rally to beat Mississippi Valley State in four sets",
        "excerpt": "Alcorn State beat Mississippi Valley State 3-1 on Sunday, Oct. 11, in Lorman after dropping the opening set.",
        "content": "<p>Alcorn State rallied past Mississippi Valley State 3-1 in volleyball Sunday, Oct. 11, in Lorman, Mississippi.</p>\n<p>The Lady Braves dropped the first set 25-19, then won 25-18, 25-19 and 25-17. The victory left Alcorn at 3-14 overall and 3-4 in the Southwestern Athletic Conference.</p>\n<p>Courtney Carter, Rylan Jones and Cristin Webb each recorded 12 kills for Alcorn. Carter also had 13 digs, while Tomoni Giddings led the team with 14. Juliana Henao and Daylin Saiki supplied 21 assists apiece, according to the official match statistics.</p>\n<p><em>Source: <a href=\"https://alcornsports.com/news/2026/10/11/womens-volleyball-lady-braves-rally-from-first-set-loss-to-beat-mvsu.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alcorn State Athletics</a></em></p>\n<p><em>Correction: An earlier version incorrectly credited William Carey with this victory. Alcorn State defeated Mississippi Valley State.</em></p>",
