        "title": "Jones College Volleyball Beats Pearl River 3-1 to Avenger Early-Season Loss",
        "content": "<p>ELLISVILLE — The No. 21 Jones College volleyball team defeated No. 25 Pearl River 3-1 Monday night in a conference match at A.B. Howard Gymnasium.</p>\n<p>Jones College improved its record and avenged an early-season loss to Pearl River, according to school officials.</p>\n<p><em>Source: <a href=\"https://jcbobcats.com/news/2026/10/12/volleyball-no-21-jones-avenges-early-season-loss-downs-no-25-pearl-river-3-1.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Original Article</a></em></p>\n",
        "excerpt": "<p>Jones College&#8217;s volleyball team secured a 3-1 win over Pearl River, avenging an earlier defeat in the season. The match was played Monday night at A.B. Howard Gymnasium.</p>\n"
      },
      "patch": {
        "title": "Jones College Volleyball Beats Pearl River 3-1 to Avenge Early-Season Loss",
        "excerpt": "No. 22 Jones College beat No. 25 Pearl River 3-1 on Monday, Oct. 12, in Ellisville, improving to 21-5 overall and 6-1 in conference play.",
        "content": "<p>ELLISVILLE — No. 22 Jones College defeated No. 25 Pearl River 3-1 in volleyball Monday, Oct. 12, at A.B. Howard Gymnasium, reversing an earlier four-set loss in Poplarville.</p>\n<p>Jones won the first two sets 25-10 and 25-20. Pearl River took the third 25-19 before the Bobcats closed the match with a 25-17 victory. Jones improved to 21-5 overall and 6-1 in conference play; Pearl River fell to 22-6 and 6-2.</p>\n<p>Myah Favre led Jones with 24 kills and added 15 digs. Selah Sandridge had 13 kills and Izzi Barnes contributed 11. Claire Wicker recorded 40 assists, while Olivia Guth led the team with 20 digs.</p>\n<p><em>Source: <a href=\"https://jcbobcats.com/news/2026/10/12/volleyball-no-22-jones-avenges-early-season-loss-downs-no-25-pearl-river-3-1.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jones College Athletics</a></em></p>\n<p><em>Correction: The headline has been corrected to “avenge,” and Jones’ ranking has been updated to No. 22 to match the official recap and box score. The source link has also been repaired.</em></p>"
      },
